<title>UK: Ramco to transfer to London's AIM market.</title>
<headline>Ramco to transfer to London's AIM market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil exploration company Ramco Energy Plc said it will move from London's Unlisted Securities Market to the Alternative Investment Market later this year.</p>
<p>The company, which is involved in oil exploration in the Caspian Sea in Azerbaijan, said it will be one of the largest companies listed on AIM.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
